{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98309","id":2598213102,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6a3ZXu","number":98309,"title":"C#: Adding `= new Array<int>()` when declaring an int array Export, makes 0 be considered a null value instead of 0","user":{"login":"cjohnson57","id":30701749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzAxNzQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30701749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57","html_url":"https://github.com/cjohnson57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjohnson57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-10-18T19:11:24Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:39:45Z","closed_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3 stable, as well as 4.3.dev5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6081) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn C#, using `Godot.Collections.Array<int>`, I ran into the following obscure issue. My habit when declaring class variables is usually to initialize them, so I did so like this:\r\n```cs\r\n[Export]\r\npublic Array<int> includedPanels = new Array<int>();\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter doing so, I initialized the array in the editor and added a value of 0 to it. However, upon running `includedPanels.Contains(0)` on it, I was surprised that it returned false.\r\n\r\nEventually, I realized that the 0 was actually being stored as  null. Bizarrely, I figured out that, if I remove the `= new Array<int>()`, then rebuild the project and re-initialize the array, then the 0 is actually stored as 0. I changed my declaration like so, before building, resetting the array in the editor, and initializing it again:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\n[Export]\r\npublic Array<int> includedPanels;\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd this produced the following change (screenshot from my Git client):\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acb39b99-337d-4d6f-8ae9-148aa7ea478b)\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a class and attach its script to a node.\r\n\r\nAdd the following properties to the class:\r\n```cs\r\n\r\n[Export]\r\npublic Array<int> noInitialValue;\r\n\r\n[Export]\r\npublic Array<int> initialValue = new Array<int>();\r\n```\r\n\r\nBuild the project, and then, in the editor, click on the node the script is attached to. Initialize both arrays with a value of 0. Open the scene file in a text editor, and you will see that the first contains `0` and the other contains `null`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98309/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}